WEBVTT

00:17.434 --> 00:21.104
A fusion of Getsugatensho
and Gran Rey Cero...

00:21.647 --> 00:26.985
A fitting power for one born from
a fusion of so many things.

00:28.028 --> 00:30.656
And yet...

00:31.156 --> 00:32.908
it still falls short!

00:52.177 --> 00:56.056
THE CALAMITY

00:57.849 --> 01:00.352
<i>I've lived my way full of shame</i>

01:00.435 --> 01:04.773
<i>"Envy" comes from the ways
of the eventual end</i>

01:04.815 --> 01:07.276
<i>The ambiguous balance</i>

01:07.359 --> 01:10.195
<i>I want to cut ties at once</i>

01:11.488 --> 01:13.030
<i>It's too late to back down now</i>

01:13.031 --> 01:14.282
<i>Before this senile body dies</i>

01:14.283 --> 01:15.993
<i>My shadow will fade away soon, but</i>

01:16.034 --> 01:18.203
<i>Even if I disappear, my journey won't stop</i>

01:18.245 --> 01:19.745
<i>Uncertain days, certain endings</i>

01:19.746 --> 01:21.414
<i>My stories fill the in-betweens</i>

01:21.415 --> 01:24.166
<i>Beyond the wall blocking my way,
there is a calm morning</i>

01:24.167 --> 01:28.463
<i>Like the rising sun,
I stand with the wind at my back</i>

01:28.589 --> 01:32.633
<i>A burst of hope?</i>

01:32.634 --> 01:34.886
<i>Break through an endless night</i>

01:34.928 --> 01:39.850
<i>Show the sun waiting
at the end of darkness</i>

01:39.933 --> 01:42.977
<i>The promise is yet to be fulfilled</i>

01:42.978 --> 01:46.523
<i>but I stand in solitude not to let it go</i>

01:46.565 --> 01:49.442
<i>At the moment,
I'm connecting numerous lights</i>

01:49.443 --> 01:53.155
<i>to form a constellation
that paves tomorrow</i>

01:53.822 --> 01:57.659
<i>Even if the rain clouds
hide the night sky away</i>

01:57.701 --> 02:01.163
<i>there certainly is a flame in my heart</i>

02:01.496 --> 02:06.335
<i>God is no longer reliable</i>

02:06.501 --> 02:11.214
<i>I glance up towards the silver lining</i>

02:11.340 --> 02:17.554
<i>The destiny of bursting fate</i>

02:17.638 --> 02:22.934
BLEACH THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

02:26.855 --> 02:29.441
Brazo Izquierdo Del Diablo...

02:30.067 --> 02:31.276
La Muerte!

02:33.570 --> 02:35.030
All right!

02:35.113 --> 02:37.824
Let's keep this pace up
and get through the rest of 'em!

02:48.794 --> 02:49.670
What?

02:50.337 --> 02:52.506
- Is it just you guys?
- Where's Ichigo?

02:52.756 --> 02:55.092
He went with Inoue to
where Yhwach is.

02:55.967 --> 02:56.802
Damn it.

02:56.885 --> 02:59.513
I guess we should just be thankful
he didn't run off by himself.

03:00.931 --> 03:02.891
- Renji!
- Go on ahead, Rukia.

03:03.225 --> 03:04.685
I'll take care of things here.

03:05.894 --> 03:06.770
Got it.

03:14.277 --> 03:16.113
You don't seem to get it...

03:16.780 --> 03:20.409
You're all just my warm up.

03:29.376 --> 03:31.670
Is running away all you're going
to do, Uryu Ishida?

03:49.229 --> 03:53.233
Now, draw your bow,
"Last of the Quincies."

03:54.317 --> 03:56.361
I'll strike down your arrows...

03:57.404 --> 04:00.073
...and expose everything about you.

04:04.911 --> 04:05.996
Go ahead and try.

04:06.788 --> 04:08.540
If your sword can reach me,
that is.

04:23.472 --> 04:25.974
A vortex of chaos like no other...

04:26.475 --> 04:27.851
That is...

04:29.144 --> 04:30.937
the very power of the Soul King.

04:34.232 --> 04:35.650
You cannot prevent it.

04:39.321 --> 04:40.489
Shitenkoshun!

04:54.586 --> 04:55.587
Tell me, Ichigo...

04:55.921 --> 04:57.547
What is power?

04:57.923 --> 04:59.466
For what purpose does it exist?

05:00.091 --> 05:02.093
You would likely answer,

05:02.552 --> 05:04.012
"It is to protect."

05:05.096 --> 05:08.934
But that kind of power
is a weak power.

05:13.480 --> 05:18.693
True power breaks men,
brings the world to its knees,

05:18.902 --> 05:21.780
and rules over all of the world.

05:22.656 --> 05:25.951
If you claim that
you will defeat me...

05:26.493 --> 05:29.412
That is the kind of power
it will be.

05:30.372 --> 05:32.332
"To protect" is a deception.

05:32.707 --> 05:34.251
Do not play the hero,

05:34.876 --> 05:35.836
Ichigo.

05:36.336 --> 05:37.212
<i>"To protect"...</i>

05:38.964 --> 05:42.384
<i>I want to protect Kurosaki...</i>

05:44.344 --> 05:46.346
<i>Since my "power" is weak...</i>

05:47.973 --> 05:50.934
<i>If only my powers were stronger,
I could...</i>

06:07.450 --> 06:08.743
Such impudence!

06:09.703 --> 06:11.288
I reject!

06:18.587 --> 06:19.629
I reject!

06:32.309 --> 06:33.184
Inoue!

06:34.227 --> 06:36.855
Do you really think you can
afford to be concerned

06:36.980 --> 06:38.106
for someone else right now?

06:51.244 --> 06:52.329
Fine then.

06:52.579 --> 06:53.830
Continue to show me...

06:54.873 --> 06:57.709
until your power is exhausted.

07:03.840 --> 07:04.883
I...

07:05.717 --> 07:08.178
I...reject...!

07:22.942 --> 07:24.736
Inoue...

07:26.112 --> 07:27.906
Stop... it!

07:29.366 --> 07:30.367
I...

07:31.201 --> 07:34.204
...reject!

07:45.006 --> 07:46.883
- You've done enough, Inoue!
- You're a pest!

07:47.133 --> 07:48.009
I reject!!!

07:56.393 --> 07:59.729
You're using the last of your power
for Ichigo?

08:03.900 --> 08:06.903
But what has that done?

08:09.739 --> 08:11.032
<i>If only my powers...</i>

08:14.327 --> 08:15.286
<i>were...</i>

08:15.912 --> 08:16.955
<i>stronger...</i>

08:23.837 --> 08:25.422
You did well enduring...

08:26.506 --> 08:27.424
...all of that, Inoue.

08:28.341 --> 08:29.467
Kuchiki...

08:31.052 --> 08:31.970
Rukia...

08:33.096 --> 08:35.223
I'm here to help, Ichigo.

08:40.353 --> 08:41.187
Are you okay,

08:41.479 --> 08:42.355
Inoue?

08:42.856 --> 08:43.732
Yes...

08:44.190 --> 08:45.775
Thanks for helping me.

08:47.277 --> 08:48.570
Let me take it from here.

08:55.785 --> 08:58.830
You've changed a lot since
I last saw you.

08:59.330 --> 09:01.373
You look like you're rolled up
in a black blanket...

09:01.374 --> 09:02.542
and you've even grown a horn!

09:02.876 --> 09:05.670
Shut up! I didn't turn into this
because I wanted to!

09:05.795 --> 09:07.380
The horn is cool!

09:07.422 --> 09:08.256
Besides, what gives?

09:08.339 --> 09:10.299
Don't show up out of nowhere
just to criticize me!

09:10.300 --> 09:13.302
What?! Is that what you say to
someone who came to help you?!

09:13.303 --> 09:14.720
I didn't ask for your help!

09:14.721 --> 09:17.223
Big words coming from someone
who's been beaten so soundly!

09:17.307 --> 09:20.310
I was just about to launch
my counterattack!

09:24.022 --> 09:25.982
Seems like you haven't
lost your spine.

09:26.858 --> 09:28.068
Damn right.

09:28.359 --> 09:29.903
Rukia Kuchiki...

09:30.528 --> 09:33.490
Are you the Soul Reaper
who guided Ichigo?

09:36.034 --> 09:39.788
If I have any Soul Reaper to thank,
it is you.

09:40.121 --> 09:43.750
You triggered the awakening
of Ichigo's powers.

09:44.584 --> 09:47.712
Then I won't need to apologize
for my rudeness.

09:49.005 --> 09:52.342
He and I will be the ones
who will take you down.

09:56.638 --> 09:57.889
Let's do this, Rukia.

09:58.139 --> 09:59.015
Right!

10:01.893 --> 10:02.852
What the matter?

10:03.186 --> 10:04.104
No originality.

10:10.527 --> 10:11.402
<i>One...</i>

10:12.403 --> 10:13.279
<i>Two...</i>

10:15.448 --> 10:16.324
<i>Three!</i>

10:17.075 --> 10:18.201
I see it.

10:20.453 --> 10:23.581
Imagine the "Last Quincy"
using his sword to attack my back...

10:23.706 --> 10:24.791
This is an "arrow."

10:25.208 --> 10:28.545
Prove that you can see what
I'm going to say, Grand Master!

10:31.297 --> 10:33.258
If there is a next time, that is.

10:42.308 --> 10:44.018
You look pathetic.

10:44.644 --> 10:46.771
But it fits you well.

10:47.230 --> 10:48.314
Uryu Ishida.

11:09.544 --> 11:11.337
That's an interesting power.

11:11.880 --> 11:15.300
It appears to shackle your ability
to fight alongside your friend.

11:16.509 --> 11:18.469
Faster, Rukia.

11:19.262 --> 11:20.555
Let's take down that bastard.

11:21.514 --> 11:22.974
No need to tell me.

12:05.975 --> 12:06.851
<i>If only...</i>

12:08.061 --> 12:09.270
<i>I had the power...</i>

12:10.647 --> 12:11.648
<i>Kurosaki...</i>

12:12.232 --> 12:16.069
<i>and Kuchiki wouldn't have
to get hurt like that...</i>

12:17.695 --> 12:19.656
<i>It's because my power is weak...</i>

12:20.823 --> 12:24.619
<i>That's why Kurosaki and Kuchiki
are suffering...</i>

12:26.746 --> 12:28.081
<i>If only my powers were...</i>

12:28.748 --> 12:30.875
<i>much much...</i>

12:31.626 --> 12:32.627
<i>stronger...</i>

12:47.392 --> 12:51.145
Return to nothingness,
you of feeble strength.

13:01.823 --> 13:04.784
Goodbye, my son.

13:18.881 --> 13:19.882
The...

13:20.633 --> 13:21.592
...moon?

13:22.927 --> 13:23.803
Ban...

13:28.725 --> 13:29.600
...kai.

13:42.155 --> 13:43.948
So you're showing it at last...

13:44.949 --> 13:47.410
Your Bankai!

14:05.219 --> 14:06.345
Kurosaki...

14:06.554 --> 14:07.430
I see...

14:07.972 --> 14:10.308
So that's your "Zangetsu."

14:17.648 --> 14:20.735
I will force all the power
you possess...

14:21.527 --> 14:23.738
to yield before me.

14:35.333 --> 14:36.334
I need this power...

14:37.668 --> 14:40.963
...to protect everyone...

14:42.048 --> 14:43.466
...from you!

14:45.510 --> 14:47.386
That was weak, Ichigo.

14:47.678 --> 14:49.806
Here I come, Yhwach.

14:56.437 --> 14:59.148
<i>What?
Was that a delayed slash?</i>

14:59.982 --> 15:00.858
No matter.

15:01.109 --> 15:02.610
I will simply parry!

15:06.030 --> 15:07.323
I felt it's impact...

15:07.990 --> 15:09.784
Why are you there?

15:16.833 --> 15:17.708
What?

15:23.673 --> 15:25.633
That despicable Spiritual Pressure!

15:59.667 --> 16:02.461
It's a power I can only describe
as different from the Soul Reapers...

16:02.628 --> 16:06.215
But I told you, Ichigo,
you're weak!

16:14.390 --> 16:17.768
It's a power that almost screams
that you don't need your friends.

16:31.282 --> 16:32.283
Getsuga...

16:41.459 --> 16:45.046
...tensho!

17:06.651 --> 17:07.735
Kurosaki...!

17:26.712 --> 17:28.464
"He's underestimating me."

17:29.549 --> 17:31.634
"I'll take him down
in this instant."

17:32.051 --> 17:33.928
That's what you were
telling yourself, correct?

17:35.513 --> 17:37.139
I'm not underestimating you.

17:37.848 --> 17:41.185
To devour you,
I need to understand you.

17:41.310 --> 17:42.853
Kill him, Ichigo!
Right now!

17:43.145 --> 17:45.773
Also, "this instant..."

17:45.940 --> 17:46.816
Getsuga...

17:47.191 --> 17:48.859
...just ended.

17:57.952 --> 17:58.953
Kurosaki...!

18:05.042 --> 18:07.003
She will be the last one
to witness you.

18:07.795 --> 18:11.090
I will make her watch you vanish
from this world,

18:11.215 --> 18:13.968
unable to protect anything,
unable to leave a legacy,

18:14.051 --> 18:17.013
and utterly powerless to act.

18:18.139 --> 18:22.602
I will... protect... Kurosaki...!

18:22.893 --> 18:25.688
I commend your strength of will.

18:26.188 --> 18:30.735
But you fall far short of being
able to fight alongside Ichigo,

18:31.152 --> 18:33.654
much less protect him.

18:34.113 --> 18:36.323
You are here because Ichigo
is unable to

18:36.324 --> 18:39.201
let go of his weakness for you.

18:39.243 --> 18:40.870
Yhwach!!

18:49.128 --> 18:53.049
That woman is your weakness now,
and in the past.

18:53.549 --> 18:56.719
Paradoxically,
what hinders your "battle"

18:57.094 --> 18:59.972
is the very reason
you grip your blade:

19:00.014 --> 19:01.766
your desire to "protect."

19:03.434 --> 19:07.146
It is because you fight that
you will be defeated.

19:08.397 --> 19:09.273
Ichigo...!

19:35.007 --> 19:35.883
Bankai.

19:41.430 --> 19:42.890
Hakka no Togame!

19:49.522 --> 19:50.564
Getsuga...

19:50.981 --> 19:53.401
...tensho!!

20:27.017 --> 20:27.893
Kuchiki!

20:32.940 --> 20:34.608
This is power.

20:36.402 --> 20:38.320
That was foolish of you.

20:40.740 --> 20:41.782
My dear Ichigo...

20:44.535 --> 20:46.662
This is where
the "power to protect"

20:46.704 --> 20:48.497
that you spoke of
inevitably leads.

20:49.373 --> 20:50.374
And...

20:51.083 --> 20:55.212
it is proof of the "strong power"
that I speak of.

20:56.756 --> 20:58.257
<i>If only my powers were...</i>

20:59.675 --> 21:02.553
<i>much... much...</i>

21:04.221 --> 21:05.181
<i>stronger...</i>

21:12.229 --> 21:14.857
Vanish like the dust, Uryu Ishida.

21:18.319 --> 21:20.112
It's exactly as I "saw" it,
Uryu Ishida!

21:20.821 --> 21:22.198
Your last resort...

21:23.240 --> 21:24.492
Leiden Hant.

21:25.284 --> 21:27.995
I see your next move, as well.

21:29.038 --> 21:31.582
Maybe you shouldn't use

21:32.082 --> 21:34.877
His Majesty Yhwach's powers
without a plan.

21:35.878 --> 21:37.296
You'll leave yourself vulnerable.

21:37.755 --> 21:38.714
Vulnerable?

21:39.590 --> 21:44.011
Is that because you managed
to get behind me?

21:48.098 --> 21:49.099
Shuno.

21:55.105 --> 21:56.106
Tsubaki.

21:58.859 --> 21:59.735
Ayame.

22:01.028 --> 22:02.029
Hinagiku.

22:05.658 --> 22:06.659
Baigon.

22:07.368 --> 22:08.285
Lily.

22:27.179 --> 22:29.348
<i>Why am I so weak?</i>

22:32.476 --> 22:35.271
<i>Why are my powers inconsequential?</i>

22:40.734 --> 22:42.194
Sternenstaub!

22:42.945 --> 22:44.113
I "see" it already!

22:48.075 --> 22:49.702
- You?!
- Three seconds!

22:50.119 --> 22:52.872
If you "saw" me looking for
a way to escape,

22:52.997 --> 22:54.707
then, that will be your undoing.

22:55.165 --> 22:57.251
Once you use your ability
to see into the future,

22:57.459 --> 22:59.587
you can't use that power again
for three seconds.

23:00.129 --> 23:02.840
A mere three seconds will not
give you a chance at victory!

23:06.010 --> 23:07.553
But it is still three seconds!

23:15.269 --> 23:18.022
<i>If only my powers were...</i>

23:19.064 --> 23:20.149
<i>much... much...</i>

23:21.233 --> 23:22.318
<i>stronger...</i>

23:24.361 --> 23:26.614
<i>So strong that I couldn't
hold it all myself...</i>

23:27.781 --> 23:29.658
<i>If it were so great
that it was boundless...</i>

23:35.372 --> 23:37.791
<i>Then I could envelop
the whole world...</i>

23:38.918 --> 23:39.877
<i>Fighting...</i>

23:40.419 --> 23:41.420
<i>pain...</i>

23:41.879 --> 23:42.963
<i>and suffering...</i>

23:44.423 --> 23:45.591
<i>I could make it so that...</i>

23:46.425 --> 23:48.260
<i>they never happened.</i>

24:02.191 --> 24:03.108
<i>That is...</i>

24:04.193 --> 24:05.110
<i>...why...</i>

24:06.278 --> 24:09.782
Are you throwing
your life away, Orihime Inoue?!

24:20.292 --> 24:21.251
Do you think this—

24:21.335 --> 24:24.588
This is going to make
your powers disappear!

24:35.933 --> 24:36.850
Wait...

24:39.186 --> 24:40.145
Inoue!

24:40.729 --> 24:42.940
You shouldn't... Inoue...

25:32.406 --> 25:34.199
<i>Bye-bye, Kurosaki!</i>

25:35.034 --> 25:38.162
<i>I'll take it all on, okay?</i>
